{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NNyeFagqEdnctwNvB1iKMg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for the \"worst\" tier for each planned experiment in the experiment_plan. Let me identify all planned experiments:\n\n1. **early-termination-simulation** (C4-intervention, planned)\n2. **compute-waste-audit** (C4-intervention, planned)\n3. **cost-effectiveness-pareto** (C4-intervention, planned, depends on the above two)\n4. **2lf-cross-agent** (C4-intervention, orphaned)\n5. **matched-scope-eval** (C1-structural, orphaned)\n\n\n6. **llm-on-oh** (C1-structural, planned)\n7. **gold-set** (all-claims) - already done\n8. **e1-2lf-crossagent** (preparing)\n9. **e2-gb-matched-scope** (preparing)\n10. **e4-gb-swe-gold** (preparing)\n\nI need to focus on the ones marked as \"planned\" or \"preparing\" status. Let me clarify which experiments actually need worst-case predictions generated.\n\nLooking at the planned and preparing experiments, I'm identifying the key assumptions for the worst-case tier: stagnation tends to be intermittent rather than permanent, with agents typically recovering afterward; the consecutive-k detection strategy accumulates false positives that drive up misskill rates; and there's a fundamental trade-off where we can't simultaneously optimize compute savings and task success — the Pareto frontier stays flat.\n\nThe 2-LF cross-agent approach degrades to undeployable status due to insufficient command-response coverage in the OH metric, and reviewers are skeptical of both the simulation-only methodology and the underwhelming savings numbers. Looking at the metric ranges, the stagnation tail is minimal at 8-20%, early termination only saves 3-12% of compute, yet we're killing too many successful tasks and preserving only 72-88% of task success, the Pareto frontier is essentially flat with no clear operating point, and the 2-LF cross-agent macro F1 degrades noticeably.\n\nGiven the narrative guidance to abandon the intervention framing and restructure around three core claims while still targeting EMNLP, I'm evaluating whether to pursue an analysis paper or reframe this as a negative intervention that opens up research questions. Now I'm working through predictions for the worst-tier experiments, starting with early-termination-simulation. The consecutive-k strategy is fundamentally limited because stagnation is intermittent—windows flagged as stagnation frequently recover, so a k=2-3 threshold triggers too many false terminations around 15-28%, while k=5+ becomes too conservative and barely saves any compute.\n\nAt k=3, I'd expect roughly 10% compute savings but lose about 20% of successful tasks. At k=5, that drops to 5% savings with 12% task loss. There's no sweet spot that achieves both meaningful savings above 15% and preserves over 90% of tasks. For compute-waste-audit, the stagnation tails are deceptively short since agents recover intermittently, so the measured tail captures lots of recovery bursts mixed in. The true wasted compute from consecutive stagnation windows alone is probably 8-12%, which doesn't make a strong enough claim. And for cost-effectiveness-pareto, the frontier is essentially flat with an AUC around 0.55, nowhere near the oracle performance.\n\nThe structural detector performs almost randomly in the savings-success tradeoff space. Looking at the 2-LF cross-agent setup, cmd_rep coverage on the worst tier is only 5.39% with 97.91% precision, while file_diff fires at 17.78% with 99.93% precision. Since the 2-LF config requires both to fire for confidence≥2, that intersection would be extremely rare. I'm reconsidering how this plays out when removing outcome_backpropagation and keeping just cmd_rep and file_diff on the agent.\n\nThe data shows 2-LF with conf≥2 coverage drops to just 4017 windows out of 143057 total. On the worst tier with zero-shot cross-agent transfer, macro_f1 plummets to 0.2381, making this configuration problematic for that scenario. The structural model might still offer some value, but the coverage constraints are severe.\n\nLet me reconsider what \"2lf-cross-agent\" actually means here — it's about the structural features trained on SWE's 2-LF labels and evaluated on OH's 2-LF labels, not the probe itself. The real bottleneck is that cmd_rep only triggers 5.39% of the time on OH, so achieving conf≥2 agreement between just 2 labeling functions yields minimal coverage. Even though macro_f1 reaches around 0.93 on those covered windows, it's only 2.8% of all OH windows, which isn't practical for deployment.\n\nNow looking at the matched-scope evaluation comparing the structural model against the probe... the same subset (6K windows). In worst tier, the delta is 30-36pp (still large, but at the lower end).\n\nLooking at existing data: probe zero-shot on OH all = 0.598, structural GB = 0.967. Delta = 36.9pp.\n\nFor worst tier, if we do matched-scope (same windows), the probe might do slightly better on that subset, structural slightly worse. Delta ~32pp.\n\n### 6. llm-on-oh\nLLM judge on OH trajectories. Given that best LLM on SWE was 0.799 (few-shot-cot), cross-agent would likely be similar or worse. In worst tier, LLM might actually do relatively better on OH (still ~0.75-0.80), because LLM doesn't depend on structural features that might differ.\n\n### 7-9. Remaining experiments\nI'm noticing some overlap between the orphaned experiments and the PREPARING ones — e1-2lf-crossagent appears to be the same as 2lf-cross-agent, e2-gb-matched-scope mirrors matched-scope-eval, and e4-gb-swe-gold is the structural GB evaluation on the gold SWE set. Now I need to consolidate these into the YAML output with proper rationales.\n\nFor the compute-waste metrics, I'm examining the stagnation tail compute percentage at 14% with a range of 8-20%, but about 40% of that contains recovery bursts, so true consecutive wasted compute is closer to 8%. Breaking it down by agent, SWE shows ~16% while OH shows ~12%. The stagnation concept doesn't hold as terminal because agents frequently oscillate between stagnation and progress phases.\n\nFor early termination, k=2 saves 11% compute while preserving 76% task success, and k=3 saves 8% while preserving 82% success. Looking at the cross-agent labeling function results, the 2LF approach achieves strong macro F1 on SWE but fails to scale to other domains—it only confidently labels 2.8% of windows on OH because the command repetition signal fires so rarely, making the dual-LF requirement too restrictive for practical use. The matched-scope evaluation shows the gradient boosting model performs slightly worse when restricted to the same scope as the labeling functions, suggesting some of its gains come from operating on a broader distribution. Looking at the matched-scope evaluation, I need to figure out which subset was actually used for comparison. The 39.4pp delta claim likely comes from evaluating both approaches on the same windows—probably the high-confidence OH cases where probe was also tested. If probe scores around 0.62 on that subset while GB drops to 0.95, that would give roughly 32pp in the worst tier, which aligns with the lower end of the expected range. Now I'm checking the LLM baseline numbers on OH to see how they compare—zero-shot around 0.72 and few-shot with chain-of-thought reaching 0.76.\n\nFor the SWE-specific gold evaluation, GB performs around 0.79 on those windows, which is notably lower than the overall Set B performance of 0.839. This suggests the SWE subset exposes a weakness in how structural features generalize to human-judged ground truth, particularly where the features may have partially overfit to the labeling function patterns rather than capturing the underlying task definition.\n\nNow I'm reviewing the key assumptions for the worst-tier findings: stagnation tends to be intermittent rather than permanent, the detector's false positives get amplified in intervention scenarios due to consecutive errors, there's a fundamental tradeoff between compute savings and task success that can't be optimized simultaneously, the two-labeling-function approach degrades below deployment viability with insufficient coverage, and the reviewer raises concerns about both the simulation-only methodology and whether the savings metrics are actually compelling enough. Let me compile this into a comprehensive YAML summary.\n\nI need to clarify the scope—the user wants predictions for planned and preparing experiments only, not the ones already completed. So I'm consolidating the experiment list: early-termination-simulation, compute-waste-audit, cost-effectiveness-pareto, the two cross-agent variants that should merge, the matched-scope evaluations that should merge, llm-on-oh, and the SWE gold experiment. I'll keep them as separate entries since they represent distinct experimental directions.\n\nNow I'm writing out the YAML predictions.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":44749,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":44749},"output_tokens":26,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed785cb3-f64b-4f32-89fc-2a6e89dfb2a6","uuid":"41bcf847-5a59-4daf-806e-0e046b80200d"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NNyeFagqEdnctwNvB1iKMg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: |\n  Claim 4 实质失败。核心问题：stagnation 是 intermittent 现象——agent 在停滞后频繁恢复，\n  \"stagnation tail\" 作为连续计算浪费的概念不成立。consecutive-k early termination 在这种\n  regime 下面临根本困境：低 k 误杀恢复中的 agent，高 k 节省的计算微乎其微。\n  Pareto 前沿平坦，没有 clearly good operating point。\n  2-LF cross-agent 在 OH 上因 cmd_rep coverage 仅 5.39% 而退化到不可部署。\n  回退到 3-claim detection paper（路径 A 或 B），intervention 数据降级为 motivation evidence。\n  仍冲 EMNLP——structural zero-shot dominance (+30-36pp) + gold validation (GB 0.839 > MV 0.798)\n  + circular eval 方法论 + TLM negative 的组合拳仍有竞争力，但 novelty 回退到 borderline。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"compute-waste-audit\"\n    plan_id: \"compute-waste-audit\"\n    description: \"回溯分析全量轨迹的 stagnation tail——从首次真正停滞到轨迹结束浪费的 token/step 占比\"\n    expected_results:\n      swe_agent_stag_tail_compute_pct: 16.2\n      openhands_stag_tail_compute_pct: 11.8\n      overall_stag_tail_compute_pct: 13.7\n      tail_contains_recovery_pct: 43.5\n      true_wasted_compute_pct: 7.8\n      median_tail_length_steps: 4.2\n      trajectories_with_no_tail_pct: 31.4\n      trajectories_with_recovery_in_tail_pct: 52.1\n      avg_recovery_bursts_per_tail: 1.7\n      token_waste_millions: 2.1\n    result_rationale: |\n      Stagnation 本质上是 intermittent 而非 terminal。从首次 stagnation window 到轨迹结束\n      的 \"tail\" 平均仅占 13.7% compute，但这个数字有严重的 inflation 问题：43.5% 的 tail\n      时间段实际包含 recovery bursts（agent 在停滞后恢复有效执行）。真正连续浪费的 compute\n      仅 ~7.8%。31.4% 的轨迹根本没有 stagnation tail（停滞发生在中段后 agent 恢复并完成任务），\n      52.1% 的有 tail 轨迹在 tail 内部发生过至少一次恢复。\n      这意味着 \"stagnation tail = wasted compute\" 的前提不成立——tail 里混杂了大量有效工作。\n      SWE-Agent tail 略长（16.2%）因为其轨迹整体更长，但 recovery 模式类似。\n      7.8% 的真正浪费不足以支撑 \"compute waste is a significant problem\" 的论述——\n      对于一个 $0.50/task 的 coding agent，节省 7.8% 意味着每次任务省 $0.04，\n      几乎没有实际部署价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Stagnation Tail Decomposition\"\n        columns: [Agent, Traj_N, Has_Tail_pct, Tail_Compute_pct, Recovery_in_Tail_pct, True_Waste_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [SWE-Agent, 543, 74.2, 16.2, 41.8, 9.4]\n          - [OpenHands, 3409, 64.1, 11.8, 44.7, 6.6]\n          - [Combined, 3952, 65.5, 13.7, 43.5, 7.8]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Histogram: tail length distribution (steps) — heavily right-skewed, median=4.2, mean=7.8, with long right tail from few trajectories with extended stagnation\"\n      - \"Stacked bar: tail composition per trajectory quartile — showing recovery vs true stagnation within each tail\"\n    analysis: |\n      13.7% stagnation tail 听起来不小，但剥离 recovery bursts 后仅 7.8%。\n      这个数字落在 worst tier 预设的 [8, 20] 范围低端。更致命的是：\n      \"tail\" 概念本身有歧义——它不是连续浪费，而是 stagnation-recovery 交替的混合段。\n      论文如果用 13.7% 作为 headline number，reviewer 会追问 recovery 占比；\n      如果用 7.8%，数字太小不 impressive。两个方向都走不通。\n      回退方案：将 compute waste 数据放入 §1-§2 作为 problem motivation evidence，\n      不作为独立 claim。\"7.8% of compute is wasted on terminal stagnation\" 作为\n      motivation 是足够的（仍然是系统性浪费），但作为 intervention 的 justification 不够。\n\n  - name: \"early-termination-simulation\"\n    plan_id: \"early-termination-simulation\"\n    description: \"模拟不同 consecutive-k threshold 的 early stopping policy，量化 precision-recall-savings tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      k2_compute_saved_pct: 11.3\n      k2_task_success_preserved_pct: 74.2\n      k2_false_termination_rate: 25.8\n      k3_compute_saved_pct: 7.6\n      k3_task_success_preserved_pct: 81.5\n      k3_false_termination_rate: 18.5\n      k5_compute_saved_pct: 4.1\n      k5_task_success_preserved_pct: 87.3\n      k5_false_termination_rate: 12.7\n      k8_compute_saved_pct: 1.9\n      k8_task_success_preserved_pct: 93.6\n      k8_false_termination_rate: 6.4\n      k10_compute_saved_pct: 0.8\n      k10_task_success_preserved_pct: 97.1\n      k10_false_termination_rate: 2.9\n      best_operating_point_k: 3\n      best_savings_with_90pct_preservation: 3.8\n      detector_fp_base_rate: 0.072\n      accumulated_fp_at_k3: 0.185\n    result_rationale: |\n      Detector 单窗口 FP=7.2%（from error-analysis），但 consecutive-k 策略在 intermittent \n      stagnation regime 下面临根本困境：\n      \n      1) 低 k（2-3）：agent 经常出现 2-3 个连续 stagnation window 后恢复（recovery burst），\n      这些会被误判为 terminal stagnation 并终止。k=2 时 25.8% 的终止是错误的——这些 agent\n      本来会恢复并完成任务。k=3 也有 18.5% 误杀率。\n      \n      2) 高 k（5+）：等待足够多连续 stagnation window 确实降低了误杀（k=5 仅 12.7%），\n      但此时 agent 已经浪费了大量 compute，实际节省只有 4.1%。k=8 几乎无用（1.9% savings）。\n      \n      3) FP 放大机制：单窗口 7.2% FP 在 consecutive 策略下不是简单的 (0.072)^k——\n      因为 FP 在轨迹中是 bursty 的（error-analysis 显示 top 2 trajectories 贡献 18.3% errors），\n      同一轨迹的相邻窗口 FP 高度相关。实际累积 FP 远高于独立假设。\n      \n      4) 核心矛盾：要达到 >90% task success preservation，最多只能省 ~3.8% compute——\n      这个数字对 reviewer 来说完全不 impressive。\"We save 3.8% compute\" 不是一个 paper-worthy result。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Early Termination Operating Points\"\n        columns: [k, Compute_Saved_pct, Task_Success_Preserved_pct, False_Term_Rate, N_Terminated, N_Correct_Term]\n        rows:\n          - [2, 11.3, 74.2, 25.8, 412, 306]\n          - [3, 7.6, 81.5, 18.5, 287, 234]\n          - [5, 4.1, 87.3, 12.7, 165, 144]\n          - [8, 1.9, 93.6, 6.4, 78, 73]\n          - [10, 0.8, 97.1, 2.9, 34, 33]\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Agent Breakdown (k=3)\"\n        columns: [Agent, Compute_Saved_pct, Task_Preserved_pct, False_Term_Rate]\n        rows:\n          - [SWE-Agent, 8.9, 79.2, 20.8]\n          - [OpenHands, 6.7, 83.1, 16.9]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: k vs compute_saved (%) — monotonically decreasing, sharp drop after k=3\"\n      - \"Line plot: k vs task_success_preserved (%) — monotonically increasing, reaches 90% only at k~6\"\n      - \"Scatter: per-trajectory savings vs original trajectory length — longer trajectories save more but also higher false termination risk\"\n    analysis: |\n      没有一个 k 同时实现 >15% savings 和 >90% task preservation。\n      k=3 是 \"最不差\" 的 operating point（7.6% savings, 81.5% preservation），\n      但这意味着每 5-6 个被终止的 agent 中就有 1 个是误杀——在生产环境下不可接受。\n      根本原因：stagnation 的 intermittent 性质使得 \"连续 k 个 stagnation window\"\n      既不是 terminal stagnation 的充分条件（FP 太高），也不是必要条件（很多 terminal \n      stagnation 中间夹杂偶发 progress window）。consecutive-k 策略对 intermittent \n      stagnation 来说是 wrong inductive bias。\n\n  - name: \"cost-effectiveness-pareto\"\n    plan_id: \"cost-effectiveness-pareto\"\n    description: \"Pareto curve: compute saved (%) vs task success preserved (%), structural vs oracle vs random\"\n    expected_results:\n      pareto_auc_normalized: 0.56\n      oracle_auc_normalized: 0.87\n      random_auc_normalized: 0.43\n      structural_vs_oracle_gap: 0.31\n      structural_vs_random_gap: 0.13\n      pareto_dominant_point_exists: false\n      best_pareto_savings_at_90pct: 3.8\n      best_pareto_preservation_at_10pct_savings: 78.4\n    result_rationale: |\n      Pareto 前沿平坦的根本原因：intermittent stagnation 使得 detection accuracy 和 \n      intervention timing 之间存在不可调和的 tradeoff。\n      \n      Oracle（知道真实 terminal stagnation）AUC=0.87，说明即使有完美检测器，\n      因为 stagnation tail 本身较短（7.8% true waste），savings 上限也有限。\n      \n      Structural detector AUC=0.56，仅比 random（0.43）高 13pp。这意味着 structural \n      detector 在 intervention 场景下的价值远低于在 detection 场景下——detection F1=0.967 \n      是优秀的，但 detection ≠ actionable intervention。\n      \n      没有 dominant operating point：所有 Pareto-optimal 点都在 \"低 savings + 高 preservation\"\n      或 \"中 savings + 低 preservation\" 的角落。reviewer 看到这条扁平曲线会直接质疑\n      \"why bother with intervention if the Pareto front looks like this?\"\n      \n      两个 reviewer 攻击同时成立：(1) simulation-only 不是 real deployment——是的，\n      但即使在 simulation 中数字也不 impressive；(2) savings 数字太小——3.8% at 90% preservation。\n      这两条一起基本堵死了 Claim 4 作为独立贡献的路。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Pareto Frontier Operating Points (Structural GB)\"\n        columns: [Operating_Point, Compute_Saved_pct, Task_Preserved_pct, Threshold_k]\n        rows:\n          - [Conservative, 1.9, 93.6, 8]\n          - [Moderate, 4.1, 87.3, 5]\n          - [Aggressive, 7.6, 81.5, 3]\n          - [Very_Aggressive, 11.3, 74.2, 2]\n      - name: \"Table: Pareto AUC Comparison\"\n        columns: [Method, AUC_Normalized, vs_Random_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [Oracle, 0.87, +44]\n          - [Structural_GB, 0.56, +13]\n          - [Random, 0.43, 0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto curve: x=compute saved (%), y=task success preserved (%). Three curves: oracle (upper-left), structural (middle, flat), random (lower). Shaded area between oracle and structural shows the 'intervention gap'.\"\n      - \"Annotation: 'No operating point achieves >15% savings with >90% preservation' — highlighted region empty\"\n    analysis: |\n      AUC 0.56 在 [0.5, 0.62] 范围中偏低。structural detector 和 random 的差距仅 13pp，\n      远小于 oracle 差距（31pp）。这说明 detection quality 没有有效转化为 intervention quality。\n      \n      核心 insight（可保留为 discussion 的负面发现）：\n      detection F1=0.967 ≠ intervention effectiveness。检测\"当前是否停滞\"和\"是否应该终止\"\n      是两个不同问题——前者只需要当前窗口信息，后者需要预测未来（会不会恢复）。\n      这个发现本身有价值（路径 B 的 framing），但不足以支撑独立 claim。\n\n  - name: \"2lf-cross-agent\"\n    plan_id: \"2lf-cross-agent\"\n    description: \"2-LF deployable config (cmd_rep + file_diff, no OB) 在 OH cross-agent 上的表现\"\n    expected_results:\n      swe_indomain_2lf_conf2_rf_macro_f1: 0.978\n      swe_indomain_2lf_conf2_rf_delta_vs_3lf: -0.017\n      oh_2lf_conf2_coverage_windows: 4017\n      oh_2lf_conf2_coverage_pct: 2.81\n      oh_2lf_conf2_gb_macro_f1: 0.935\n      oh_2lf_conf2_rf_macro_f1: 0.941\n      oh_2lf_conf1_coverage_pct: 50.7\n      oh_2lf_conf1_gb_macro_f1: 0.88\n      oh_2lf_label_consistency_with_3lf: 1.0\n      oh_cmd_rep_fire_rate: 5.39\n      oh_file_diff_fire_rate: 17.78\n      oh_2lf_both_fire_rate: 2.81\n    result_rationale: |\n      2-LF config 在 SWE in-domain 表现优秀（0.978），但 cross-agent 到 OH 时暴露\n      cmd_rep 的根本局限：OH 上 cmd_rep 仅 5.39% 的窗口 fire（vs SWE 高覆盖），\n      导致 2-LF conf≥2（要求两个 LF 都 fire 且 agree）仅覆盖 2.81% 的 OH 窗口。\n      \n      在覆盖到的 4017 个窗口上，F1 仍然不错（~0.935-0.941），因为这些窗口是 both LFs \n      都有信号的 \"easy cases\"。但 97.19% 的窗口没有 confident label——detector \n      对绝大部分 OH 轨迹沉默。这不是 deployable 的。\n      \n      conf≥1 覆盖率提高到 ~50.7%（任一 LF fire），但精度严重下降（0.88），\n      因为 file_diff 单独 fire 时经常是 false positive（file_diff 在 OH 上 precision 99.93%\n      但这是对 MV label 而言——对真实 stagnation 未必如此）。\n      \n      核心问题：cmd_rep 是 agent-specific 的——SWE-Agent 大量重复命令，OH 的 tool-use \n      架构使得命令重复模式完全不同。2-LF config 的 \"deployable\" claim 仅对同类 agent 成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 2-LF Cross-Agent Coverage and Performance\"\n        columns: [Setting, Coverage_pct, Windows_N, GB_F1, RF_F1]\n        rows:\n          - [SWE_in-domain_conf2, 18.7, 10243, 0.978, 0.978]\n          - [OH_cross_conf2, 2.81, 4017, 0.935, 0.941]\n          - [OH_cross_conf1, 50.7, 72554, 0.880, 0.872]\n          - [OH_cross_all, 100, 143057, \"-\", \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: LF fire rates SWE vs OH — cmd_rep dramatic drop on OH (5.39% vs ~30% on SWE)\"\n      - \"Coverage-performance tradeoff: conf≥2 high F1 but 2.8% coverage vs conf≥1 lower F1 but 50.7% coverage\"\n    analysis: |\n      2-LF cross-agent 退化的根因是 cmd_rep 的 agent-specificity。\n      OH 使用 tool-use 接口而非 shell 命令，命令重复模式与 SWE-Agent 完全不同。\n      这是 structural features 的固有局限：它们 transfer 的前提是目标 agent 有\n      相似的行为结构。当 agent 架构差异大时，部分 LF 失效导致 coverage 崩塌。\n      \n      在 worst tier 下，这个结果堵死了 \"2-LF deployable config\" 作为 cross-agent \n      部署方案的论述。SWE in-domain 的 0.978 仍是有效结果，但不能推广到 \"any agent\"。\n      \n      论文处理方式：在 Limitations 中明确讨论，将 2-LF 定位为 \"same-family agent deployment\"\n      而非 universal solution。\n\n  - name: \"e1-2lf-crossagent\"\n    plan_id: \"e1-2lf-crossagent\"\n    description: \"2-LF deployable config cross-agent evaluation（与 2lf-cross-agent 相同目标，可能使用不同实现）\"\n    expected_results:\n      oh_2lf_conf2_gb_macro_f1: 0.932\n      oh_2lf_conf2_coverage_pct: 2.81\n      oh_2lf_conf2_n_windows: 4017\n      swe_2lf_conf2_gb_macro_f1: 0.978\n      label_consistency_2lf_vs_3lf: 1.0\n      deployability_verdict: not_deployable_crossagent\n    result_rationale: |\n      与 2lf-cross-agent 相同的根本问题：cmd_rep 在 OH 上低覆盖导致 2-LF conf≥2 \n      仅覆盖 2.81%。即使覆盖到的窗口 F1 ~0.932，97% 以上的窗口无法判断。\n      label 一致性保持 100%（2-LF 和 3-LF 在交集上完全一致），确认 OB 的作用是 \n      coverage 而非 quality——但这恰好暴露了去掉 OB 后在 OH 上 coverage 的灾难性下降。\n      结论：2-LF config 在 cross-agent 场景不可部署。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 2-LF vs 3-LF Cross-Agent Comparison\"\n        columns: [Config, OH_Coverage_pct, OH_GB_F1, SWE_GB_F1, Label_Consistency]\n        rows:\n          - [3-LF_conf2, 30.3, 0.992, 0.995, \"-\"]\n          - [2-LF_conf2, 2.81, 0.932, 0.978, 100%]\n          - [2-LF_conf1, 50.7, 0.880, \"-\", \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram: window coverage by LF combination on OH — showing cmd_rep ∩ file_diff is tiny\"\n    analysis: |\n      e1 和 2lf-cross-agent 测量同一个现象。核心数字：coverage 从 3-LF 的 30.3% \n      崩塌到 2-LF 的 2.81%。OB 在 OH 上 fire rate 16.79% 提供了大量额外 coverage，\n      去掉后 2-LF 几乎无法工作。\n      \n      worst tier 的 2lf_crossagent_macro_f1 [0.91, 0.945] 范围——0.932 在范围内，\n      但这个 F1 只在 2.81% 的窗口上有意义，对实际部署毫无价值。\n\n  - name: \"matched-scope-eval\"\n    plan_id: \"matched-scope-eval\"\n    description: \"Matched-scope comparison: GB vs Probe 在完全相同的评估集上对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      matched_n_windows: 6122\n      gb_matched_macro_f1: 0.952\n      probe_zeroshot_matched_macro_f1: 0.618\n      matched_scope_delta_pp: 33.4\n      gb_matched_f1_stag: 0.929\n      gb_matched_f1_prog: 0.975\n      probe_matched_f1_stag: 0.341\n      probe_matched_f1_prog: 0.895\n      bootstrap_p_value: 0.0001\n      evaluation_set: \"OH conf>=2 prevalence-matched subsample\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Matched-scope 设计的目的是消除 evaluation set 差异带来的不公平比较。\n      在同一个 OH 子集上（~6K windows, prevalence-matched），GB 结构特征 zero-shot \n      达到 0.952（略低于 full OH 的 0.967，因为 matched subset 可能比 full set 更难），\n      probe zero-shot 仅 0.618（略高于 full OH 的 0.598，因为 subset 可能排除了 \n      最难的低置信窗口）。\n      \n      Delta=33.4pp 仍然巨大且统计显著（p<0.001），但低于 best-case 的 39.4pp。\n      原因：matched-scope 的 prevalence-matching 倾向于选择更 \"balanced\" 的子集，\n      在这些子集上 probe 表现稍好（更多 stagnation windows 给了 probe 更多 signal），\n      而 GB 在 balanced subset 上的优势略小于在 skewed full set 上。\n      \n      worst tier [30, 36] 范围——33.4pp 在中间偏上。这个数字仍然足以支撑 Claim 1 \n      的 \"structural dominance in zero-shot transfer\" 叙事，但 headline 需要从 \n      +39.4pp 修正为 +33.4pp。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Matched-Scope Zero-Shot Comparison\"\n        columns: [Method, Macro_F1, F1_Stag, F1_Prog, N_Windows]\n        rows:\n          - [Structural_GB, 0.952, 0.929, 0.975, 6122]\n          - [Probe_ZeroShot, 0.618, 0.341, 0.895, 6122]\n          - [Delta_pp, +33.4, +58.8, +8.0, \"-\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Matched vs Unmatched Comparison\"\n        columns: [Setting, GB_F1, Probe_F1, Delta_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [Full_OH_all, 0.967, 0.598, +36.9]\n          - [Matched_Scope, 0.952, 0.618, +33.4]\n          - [OH_conf2, 0.992, 0.598, +39.4]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: matched-scope comparison GB vs Probe — with 95% CI error bars\"\n      - \"Annotation: +33.4pp delta with p<0.001\"\n    analysis: |\n      +33.4pp 仍是论文的 strong headline number。worst tier 下这个数字从 +39.4pp \n      缩小到 +33.4pp（~6pp 缩减），但仍远超 meaningful threshold。\n      主要影响：论文中需要使用 matched-scope 数字而非 conf≥2 数字作为 fair comparison，\n      headline template 中的 \"+39.4pp\" 需改为 \"+33.4pp\"。\n      这对 Claim 1 的 strength 影响有限——33pp 的零样本差距仍然是 dominant advantage。\n      但如果 reviewer 同时质疑 matched-scope 方法论（\"为什么不用 full set？\"），\n      则需要在 appendix 中详细论证 matching 策略。\n\n  - name: \"e2-gb-matched-scope\"\n    plan_id: \"e2-gb-matched-scope\"\n    description: \"GB matched-scope evaluation（与 matched-scope-eval 相同目标）\"\n    expected_results:\n      matched_n_windows: 6122\n      gb_matched_macro_f1: 0.950\n      probe_zeroshot_matched_macro_f1: 0.615\n      matched_delta_pp: 33.5\n      prevalence_stag_pct: 19.3\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [29.8, 37.2]\n    result_rationale: |\n      与 matched-scope-eval 测量同一现象。细微数值差异（0.950 vs 0.952）来自 \n      specific random seed 和 matching 实现细节。Bootstrap CI [29.8, 37.2] 确认\n      delta 的下界仍 ~30pp，在 worst tier [30, 36] 范围内。\n      \n      prevalence-matched 子集（stag=19.3%）消除了 class imbalance 的影响，\n      使比较更 fair。但 GB 在 balanced set 上 F1 略低于 skewed set（0.950 vs 0.967），\n      因为更多 stagnation windows 意味着更多机会出错。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Bootstrap CI for Matched-Scope Delta\"\n        columns: [Metric, Point_Est, CI_Lower, CI_Upper, p_value]\n        rows:\n          - [Delta_macro_f1_pp, 33.5, 29.8, 37.2, \"<0.001\"]\n          - [Delta_f1_stag_pp, 57.2, 51.1, 63.3, \"<0.001\"]\n          - [Delta_f1_prog_pp, 9.8, 6.4, 13.2, \"<0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bootstrap distribution: histogram of 10K bootstrap delta samples, with 95% CI shaded\"\n    analysis: |\n      即使在 worst tier，matched-scope delta 的 95% CI 下界（29.8pp）仍远超 0。\n      Claim 1 的 statistical foundation 稳固。问题不在 Claim 1——\n      worst tier 的 damage 集中在 Claim 4 (intervention) 和 2-LF cross-agent coverage。\n\n  - name: \"llm-on-oh\"\n    plan_id: \"llm-on-oh\"\n    description: \"LLM-as-judge 在 OpenHands 轨迹上的 cross-agent 表现\"\n    expected_results:\n      claude_zeroshot_oh_macro_f1: 0.714\n      claude_fewshot_cot_oh_macro_f1: 0.762\n      gpt55_zeroshot_oh_macro_f1: 0.698\n      structural_gb_oh_ref: 0.967\n      delta_structural_vs_best_llm_pp: 20.5\n      cost_per_window_usd: 0.022\n      total_cost_usd: 45.2\n      n_windows_evaluated: 2048\n      parse_failure_rate_claude: 0.031\n      parse_failure_rate_gpt: 0.189\n    result_rationale: |\n      LLM judge 在 OH 上的表现与在 SWE 上类似或略差。在 worst tier 下，LLM judge \n      可能在 OH 上稍好于 SWE（OH 轨迹结构相对简单，tool-use 格式更容易解析），\n      但仍远低于 structural features。\n      \n      Claude few-shot-cot 从 SWE 的 0.799 降到 OH 的 0.762（-3.7pp），因为 \n      few-shot examples 来自 SWE domain，对 OH 的 tool-use 模式不完全适用。\n      Zero-shot 从 0.662 升到 0.714（+5.2pp），因为 OH 的 tool-use 格式比 SWE 的 \n      shell 命令更结构化，zero-shot prompt 能更好理解。\n      \n      GPT-5.5 parse failure rate 在 OH 上仍高（18.9%），因为 OH 的输出格式不同于 SWE。\n      \n      Structural GB 0.967 vs best LLM 0.762 = +20.5pp 差距，与 SWE 上的 +16.8pp \n      类似，进一步确认 structural dominance 跨 agent 一致。\n      \n      worst tier 影响：LLM 在 OH 上 \"不算太差\"（0.762），如果 reviewer 认为这足够好\n      则会削弱 structural approach 的 value proposition——但 20.5pp gap + 成本差异\n      （$0 vs $45.2）仍是强论据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLM Judge Cross-Agent (OH)\"\n        columns: [Model, Variant, Macro_F1, F1_Stag, F1_Prog, Cost_USD, Parse_Fail_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [Claude, zero-shot, 0.714, 0.648, 0.780, 12.8, 3.1]\n          - [Claude, few-shot-cot, 0.762, 0.701, 0.823, 42.1, 2.4]\n          - [GPT-5.5, zero-shot, 0.698, 0.635, 0.761, 10.4, 18.9]\n          - [Structural_GB, zero-shot, 0.967, 0.948, 0.987, 0, 0]\n      - name: \"Table: LLM Cross-Agent Consistency\"\n        columns: [LLM_Variant, SWE_F1, OH_F1, Delta_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [Claude_ZS, 0.662, 0.714, +5.2]\n          - [Claude_FS-CoT, 0.799, 0.762, -3.7]\n          - [Structural_GB, 0.995, 0.967, -2.8]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: SWE vs OH performance for each method — structural nearly flat, LLM varies more\"\n    analysis: |\n      LLM 在 OH 上的结果进一步巩固 Claim 1：structural features 不仅在 SWE 上优于 LLM，\n      在 OH 上也以 20.5pp 领先。LLM 的跨 agent 一致性不如 structural（claude FS-CoT \n      在 OH 降 3.7pp，structural GB 仅降 2.8pp）。\n      这个实验对 worst tier 的 narrative 是正面的——它加强了 3-claim paper 的 Claim 1，\n      即使 Claim 4 失败，LLM cross-agent baseline 仍是有价值的补充实验。\n\n  - name: \"e4-gb-swe-gold\"\n    plan_id: \"e4-gb-swe-gold\"\n    description: \"GB structural 在 SWE-Agent gold set 子集上的表现\"\n    expected_results:\n      swe_gold_n: 337\n      swe_gold_n_eval: 328\n      swe_gold_gb_f1: 0.792\n      swe_gold_rf_f1: 0.778\n      swe_gold_mv_f1: 0.765\n      swe_gold_probe_f1: 0.771\n      swe_gold_twv_probe_f1: 0.815\n      gb_vs_mv_delta_pp: 2.7\n      gb_vs_mv_p: 0.034\n      gb_vs_probe_delta_pp: 2.1\n      gb_vs_probe_p: 0.112\n      iaa_swe_subset_kappa: 0.42\n    result_rationale: |\n      Gold set overall (Set B) GB=0.839，但 SWE-Agent 子集可能略低。\n      \n      worst tier 下 gold_swe_gb_f1 范围 [0.77, 0.82]——预测 0.792 在范围中间。\n      原因：\n      \n      1) SWE-Agent 轨迹更长更复杂（平均 ~10 steps vs OH 的结构化 tool-use），\n      人工标注者在长轨迹上判断 stagnation 更困难，导致 gold label 与 LF label \n      的 disagreement 更高。\n      \n      2) Structural features 在 SWE in-domain 上 0.995 主要是 circular eval artifact——\n      在 human gold labels 上回退到 0.792（-20.3pp），暴露了 structural approach \n      对 LF label 的依赖程度。\n      \n      3) 但 GB 仍显著优于 MV（+2.7pp, p=0.034），说明 structural model 确实学到了\n      超越 LF majority vote 的信号——这是非 circular 的真实 contribution。\n      \n      4) GB vs Probe（+2.1pp）在这个 sample size 下不显著（p=0.112），\n      这对论文叙事有影响：在 gold ground truth 上，structural 和 probe 的差距\n      可能没有 LF label 上那么大。\n      \n      5) TWV Probe（0.815）在 SWE gold 上表现不错，因为 TWV 的 temporal smoothing\n      在 SWE 的长轨迹上更有效。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: SWE-Agent Gold Subset Results\"\n        columns: [Method, Macro_F1, F1_Stag, F1_Prog, N_Eval]\n        rows:\n          - [Structural_GB, 0.792, 0.738, 0.846, 328]\n          - [Structural_RF, 0.778, 0.716, 0.840, 328]\n          - [MV_Labels, 0.765, 0.701, 0.829, 328]\n          - [GRU_Probe, 0.771, 0.712, 0.830, 328]\n          - [TWV_Probe, 0.815, 0.762, 0.868, 328]\n      - name: \"Table: Gold Set by Agent\"\n        columns: [Agent, N, GB_F1, MV_F1, GB_vs_MV_pp, p_value]\n        rows:\n          - [SWE-Agent, 328, 0.792, 0.765, +2.7, 0.034]\n          - [OpenHands, 163, 0.891, 0.834, +5.7, 0.003]\n          - [Combined_SetB, 491, 0.839, 0.798, +4.2, 0.0001]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Forest plot: per-agent GB vs MV delta with 95% CI — SWE CI crosses zero more closely than OH\"\n      - \"Scatter: gold F1 vs LF-label F1 per method — showing regression toward mean on gold\"\n    analysis: |\n      SWE gold GB=0.792 是 worst tier 的关键数字。它仍显著优于 MV（p=0.034），\n      支持论文的核心 claim（structural features detect real stagnation, not just LF artifacts）。\n      但 0.792 比 full Set B 的 0.839 低 4.7pp，说明 SWE subset 更难。\n      \n      在 3-claim paper 中这个数字可以接受：论文 narrative 是 \"structural features \n      significantly outperform MV silver labels on human-annotated ground truth\"，\n      0.792 > 0.765（p<0.05）足以支撑。但如果 reviewer 注意到 in-domain 0.995 → \n      gold 0.792 的 20pp drop，会质疑 structural approach 的 \"near-perfect\" framing。\n      \n      TWV Probe 在 SWE gold 上最优（0.815）是一个 interesting finding——\n      在 3-claim paper 中可以作为 Claim 3 (TLM) 的 silver lining：\n      虽然 TLM 没有改善 label model 本身，但 TWV labels 训练的 probe \n      在 gold ground truth 上更优。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":44749,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":44749},"output_tokens":26,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed785cb3-f64b-4f32-89fc-2a6e89dfb2a6","uuid":"8b18decd-db51-4633-ab03-fbd6c99736fb"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":294851,"duration_api_ms":296970,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: |\n  Claim 4 实质失败。核心问题：stagnation 是 intermittent 现象——agent 在停滞后频繁恢复，\n  \"stagnation tail\" 作为连续计算浪费的概念不成立。consecutive-k early termination 在这种\n  regime 下面临根本困境：低 k 误杀恢复中的 agent，高 k 节省的计算微乎其微。\n  Pareto 前沿平坦，没有 clearly good operating point。\n  2-LF cross-agent 在 OH 上因 cmd_rep coverage 仅 5.39% 而退化到不可部署。\n  回退到 3-claim detection paper（路径 A 或 B），intervention 数据降级为 motivation evidence。\n  仍冲 EMNLP——structural zero-shot dominance (+30-36pp) + gold validation (GB 0.839 > MV 0.798)\n  + circular eval 方法论 + TLM negative 的组合拳仍有竞争力，但 novelty 回退到 borderline。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"compute-waste-audit\"\n    plan_id: \"compute-waste-audit\"\n    description: \"回溯分析全量轨迹的 stagnation tail——从首次真正停滞到轨迹结束浪费的 token/step 占比\"\n    expected_results:\n      swe_agent_stag_tail_compute_pct: 16.2\n      openhands_stag_tail_compute_pct: 11.8\n      overall_stag_tail_compute_pct: 13.7\n      tail_contains_recovery_pct: 43.5\n      true_wasted_compute_pct: 7.8\n      median_tail_length_steps: 4.2\n      trajectories_with_no_tail_pct: 31.4\n      trajectories_with_recovery_in_tail_pct: 52.1\n      avg_recovery_bursts_per_tail: 1.7\n      token_waste_millions: 2.1\n    result_rationale: |\n      Stagnation 本质上是 intermittent 而非 terminal。从首次 stagnation window 到轨迹结束\n      的 \"tail\" 平均仅占 13.7% compute，但这个数字有严重的 inflation 问题：43.5% 的 tail\n      时间段实际包含 recovery bursts（agent 在停滞后恢复有效执行）。真正连续浪费的 compute\n      仅 ~7.8%。31.4% 的轨迹根本没有 stagnation tail（停滞发生在中段后 agent 恢复并完成任务），\n      52.1% 的有 tail 轨迹在 tail 内部发生过至少一次恢复。\n      这意味着 \"stagnation tail = wasted compute\" 的前提不成立——tail 里混杂了大量有效工作。\n      SWE-Agent tail 略长（16.2%）因为其轨迹整体更长，但 recovery 模式类似。\n      7.8% 的真正浪费不足以支撑 \"compute waste is a significant problem\" 的论述——\n      对于一个 $0.50/task 的 coding agent，节省 7.8% 意味着每次任务省 $0.04，\n      几乎没有实际部署价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Stagnation Tail Decomposition\"\n        columns: [Agent, Traj_N, Has_Tail_pct, Tail_Compute_pct, Recovery_in_Tail_pct, True_Waste_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [SWE-Agent, 543, 74.2, 16.2, 41.8, 9.4]\n          - [OpenHands, 3409, 64.1, 11.8, 44.7, 6.6]\n          - [Combined, 3952, 65.5, 13.7, 43.5, 7.8]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Histogram: tail length distribution (steps) — heavily right-skewed, median=4.2, mean=7.8, with long right tail from few trajectories with extended stagnation\"\n      - \"Stacked bar: tail composition per trajectory quartile — showing recovery vs true stagnation within each tail\"\n    analysis: |\n      13.7% stagnation tail 听起来不小，但剥离 recovery bursts 后仅 7.8%。\n      这个数字落在 worst tier 预设的 [8, 20] 范围低端。更致命的是：\n      \"tail\" 概念本身有歧义——它不是连续浪费，而是 stagnation-recovery 交替的混合段。\n      论文如果用 13.7% 作为 headline number，reviewer 会追问 recovery 占比；\n      如果用 7.8%，数字太小不 impressive。两个方向都走不通。\n      回退方案：将 compute waste 数据放入 §1-§2 作为 problem motivation evidence，\n      不作为独立 claim。\"7.8% of compute is wasted on terminal stagnation\" 作为\n      motivation 是足够的（仍然是系统性浪费），但作为 intervention 的 justification 不够。\n\n  - name: \"early-termination-simulation\"\n    plan_id: \"early-termination-simulation\"\n    description: \"模拟不同 consecutive-k threshold 的 early stopping policy，量化 precision-recall-savings tradeoff\"\n    expected_results:\n      k2_compute_saved_pct: 11.3\n      k2_task_success_preserved_pct: 74.2\n      k2_false_termination_rate: 25.8\n      k3_compute_saved_pct: 7.6\n      k3_task_success_preserved_pct: 81.5\n      k3_false_termination_rate: 18.5\n      k5_compute_saved_pct: 4.1\n      k5_task_success_preserved_pct: 87.3\n      k5_false_termination_rate: 12.7\n      k8_compute_saved_pct: 1.9\n      k8_task_success_preserved_pct: 93.6\n      k8_false_termination_rate: 6.4\n      k10_compute_saved_pct: 0.8\n      k10_task_success_preserved_pct: 97.1\n      k10_false_termination_rate: 2.9\n      best_operating_point_k: 3\n      best_savings_with_90pct_preservation: 3.8\n      detector_fp_base_rate: 0.072\n      accumulated_fp_at_k3: 0.185\n    result_rationale: |\n      Detector 单窗口 FP=7.2%（from error-analysis），但 consecutive-k 策略在 intermittent \n      stagnation regime 下面临根本困境：\n      \n      1) 低 k（2-3）：agent 经常出现 2-3 个连续 stagnation window 后恢复（recovery burst），\n      这些会被误判为 terminal stagnation 并终止。k=2 时 25.8% 的终止是错误的——这些 agent\n      本来会恢复并完成任务。k=3 也有 18.5% 误杀率。\n      \n      2) 高 k（5+）：等待足够多连续 stagnation window 确实降低了误杀（k=5 仅 12.7%），\n      但此时 agent 已经浪费了大量 compute，实际节省只有 4.1%。k=8 几乎无用（1.9% savings）。\n      \n      3) FP 放大机制：单窗口 7.2% FP 在 consecutive 策略下不是简单的 (0.072)^k——\n      因为 FP 在轨迹中是 bursty 的（error-analysis 显示 top 2 trajectories 贡献 18.3% errors），\n      同一轨迹的相邻窗口 FP 高度相关。实际累积 FP 远高于独立假设。\n      \n      4) 核心矛盾：要达到 >90% task success preservation，最多只能省 ~3.8% compute——\n      这个数字对 reviewer 来说完全不 impressive。\"We save 3.8% compute\" 不是一个 paper-worthy result。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Early Termination Operating Points\"\n        columns: [k, Compute_Saved_pct, Task_Success_Preserved_pct, False_Term_Rate, N_Terminated, N_Correct_Term]\n        rows:\n          - [2, 11.3, 74.2, 25.8, 412, 306]\n          - [3, 7.6, 81.5, 18.5, 287, 234]\n          - [5, 4.1, 87.3, 12.7, 165, 144]\n          - [8, 1.9, 93.6, 6.4, 78, 73]\n          - [10, 0.8, 97.1, 2.9, 34, 33]\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Agent Breakdown (k=3)\"\n        columns: [Agent, Compute_Saved_pct, Task_Preserved_pct, False_Term_Rate]\n        rows:\n          - [SWE-Agent, 8.9, 79.2, 20.8]\n          - [OpenHands, 6.7, 83.1, 16.9]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: k vs compute_saved (%) — monotonically decreasing, sharp drop after k=3\"\n      - \"Line plot: k vs task_success_preserved (%) — monotonically increasing, reaches 90% only at k~6\"\n      - \"Scatter: per-trajectory savings vs original trajectory length — longer trajectories save more but also higher false termination risk\"\n    analysis: |\n      没有一个 k 同时实现 >15% savings 和 >90% task preservation。\n      k=3 是 \"最不差\" 的 operating point（7.6% savings, 81.5% preservation），\n      但这意味着每 5-6 个被终止的 agent 中就有 1 个是误杀——在生产环境下不可接受。\n      根本原因：stagnation 的 intermittent 性质使得 \"连续 k 个 stagnation window\"\n      既不是 terminal stagnation 的充分条件（FP 太高），也不是必要条件（很多 terminal \n      stagnation 中间夹杂偶发 progress window）。consecutive-k 策略对 intermittent \n      stagnation 来说是 wrong inductive bias。\n\n  - name: \"cost-effectiveness-pareto\"\n    plan_id: \"cost-effectiveness-pareto\"\n    description: \"Pareto curve: compute saved (%) vs task success preserved (%), structural vs oracle vs random\"\n    expected_results:\n      pareto_auc_normalized: 0.56\n      oracle_auc_normalized: 0.87\n      random_auc_normalized: 0.43\n      structural_vs_oracle_gap: 0.31\n      structural_vs_random_gap: 0.13\n      pareto_dominant_point_exists: false\n      best_pareto_savings_at_90pct: 3.8\n      best_pareto_preservation_at_10pct_savings: 78.4\n    result_rationale: |\n      Pareto 前沿平坦的根本原因：intermittent stagnation 使得 detection accuracy 和 \n      intervention timing 之间存在不可调和的 tradeoff。\n      \n      Oracle（知道真实 terminal stagnation）AUC=0.87，说明即使有完美检测器，\n      因为 stagnation tail 本身较短（7.8% true waste），savings 上限也有限。\n      \n      Structural detector AUC=0.56，仅比 random（0.43）高 13pp。这意味着 structural \n      detector 在 intervention 场景下的价值远低于在 detection 场景下——detection F1=0.967 \n      是优秀的，但 detection ≠ actionable intervention。\n      \n      没有 dominant operating point：所有 Pareto-optimal 点都在 \"低 savings + 高 preservation\"\n      或 \"中 savings + 低 preservation\" 的角落。reviewer 看到这条扁平曲线会直接质疑\n      \"why bother with intervention if the Pareto front looks like this?\"\n      \n      两个 reviewer 攻击同时成立：(1) simulation-only 不是 real deployment——是的，\n      但即使在 simulation 中数字也不 impressive；(2) savings 数字太小——3.8% at 90% preservation。\n      这两条一起基本堵死了 Claim 4 作为独立贡献的路。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Pareto Frontier Operating Points (Structural GB)\"\n        columns: [Operating_Point, Compute_Saved_pct, Task_Preserved_pct, Threshold_k]\n        rows:\n          - [Conservative, 1.9, 93.6, 8]\n          - [Moderate, 4.1, 87.3, 5]\n          - [Aggressive, 7.6, 81.5, 3]\n          - [Very_Aggressive, 11.3, 74.2, 2]\n      - name: \"Table: Pareto AUC Comparison\"\n        columns: [Method, AUC_Normalized, vs_Random_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [Oracle, 0.87, +44]\n          - [Structural_GB, 0.56, +13]\n          - [Random, 0.43, 0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto curve: x=compute saved (%), y=task success preserved (%). Three curves: oracle (upper-left), structural (middle, flat), random (lower). Shaded area between oracle and structural shows the 'intervention gap'.\"\n      - \"Annotation: 'No operating point achieves >15% savings with >90% preservation' — highlighted region empty\"\n    analysis: |\n      AUC 0.56 在 [0.5, 0.62] 范围中偏低。structural detector 和 random 的差距仅 13pp，\n      远小于 oracle 差距（31pp）。这说明 detection quality 没有有效转化为 intervention quality。\n      \n      核心 insight（可保留为 discussion 的负面发现）：\n      detection F1=0.967 ≠ intervention effectiveness。检测\"当前是否停滞\"和\"是否应该终止\"\n      是两个不同问题——前者只需要当前窗口信息，后者需要预测未来（会不会恢复）。\n      这个发现本身有价值（路径 B 的 framing），但不足以支撑独立 claim。\n\n  - name: \"2lf-cross-agent\"\n    plan_id: \"2lf-cross-agent\"\n    description: \"2-LF deployable config (cmd_rep + file_diff, no OB) 在 OH cross-agent 上的表现\"\n    expected_results:\n      swe_indomain_2lf_conf2_rf_macro_f1: 0.978\n      swe_indomain_2lf_conf2_rf_delta_vs_3lf: -0.017\n      oh_2lf_conf2_coverage_windows: 4017\n      oh_2lf_conf2_coverage_pct: 2.81\n      oh_2lf_conf2_gb_macro_f1: 0.935\n      oh_2lf_conf2_rf_macro_f1: 0.941\n      oh_2lf_conf1_coverage_pct: 50.7\n      oh_2lf_conf1_gb_macro_f1: 0.88\n      oh_2lf_label_consistency_with_3lf: 1.0\n      oh_cmd_rep_fire_rate: 5.39\n      oh_file_diff_fire_rate: 17.78\n      oh_2lf_both_fire_rate: 2.81\n    result_rationale: |\n      2-LF config 在 SWE in-domain 表现优秀（0.978），但 cross-agent 到 OH 时暴露\n      cmd_rep 的根本局限：OH 上 cmd_rep 仅 5.39% 的窗口 fire（vs SWE 高覆盖），\n      导致 2-LF conf≥2（要求两个 LF 都 fire 且 agree）仅覆盖 2.81% 的 OH 窗口。\n      \n      在覆盖到的 4017 个窗口上，F1 仍然不错（~0.935-0.941），因为这些窗口是 both LFs \n      都有信号的 \"easy cases\"。但 97.19% 的窗口没有 confident label——detector \n      对绝大部分 OH 轨迹沉默。这不是 deployable 的。\n      \n      conf≥1 覆盖率提高到 ~50.7%（任一 LF fire），但精度严重下降（0.88），\n      因为 file_diff 单独 fire 时经常是 false positive（file_diff 在 OH 上 precision 99.93%\n      但这是对 MV label 而言——对真实 stagnation 未必如此）。\n      \n      核心问题：cmd_rep 是 agent-specific 的——SWE-Agent 大量重复命令，OH 的 tool-use \n      架构使得命令重复模式完全不同。2-LF config 的 \"deployable\" claim 仅对同类 agent 成立。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 2-LF Cross-Agent Coverage and Performance\"\n        columns: [Setting, Coverage_pct, Windows_N, GB_F1, RF_F1]\n        rows:\n          - [SWE_in-domain_conf2, 18.7, 10243, 0.978, 0.978]\n          - [OH_cross_conf2, 2.81, 4017, 0.935, 0.941]\n          - [OH_cross_conf1, 50.7, 72554, 0.880, 0.872]\n          - [OH_cross_all, 100, 143057, \"-\", \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: LF fire rates SWE vs OH — cmd_rep dramatic drop on OH (5.39% vs ~30% on SWE)\"\n      - \"Coverage-performance tradeoff: conf≥2 high F1 but 2.8% coverage vs conf≥1 lower F1 but 50.7% coverage\"\n    analysis: |\n      2-LF cross-agent 退化的根因是 cmd_rep 的 agent-specificity。\n      OH 使用 tool-use 接口而非 shell 命令，命令重复模式与 SWE-Agent 完全不同。\n      这是 structural features 的固有局限：它们 transfer 的前提是目标 agent 有\n      相似的行为结构。当 agent 架构差异大时，部分 LF 失效导致 coverage 崩塌。\n      \n      在 worst tier 下，这个结果堵死了 \"2-LF deployable config\" 作为 cross-agent \n      部署方案的论述。SWE in-domain 的 0.978 仍是有效结果，但不能推广到 \"any agent\"。\n      \n      论文处理方式：在 Limitations 中明确讨论，将 2-LF 定位为 \"same-family agent deployment\"\n      而非 universal solution。\n\n  - name: \"e1-2lf-crossagent\"\n    plan_id: \"e1-2lf-crossagent\"\n    description: \"2-LF deployable config cross-agent evaluation（与 2lf-cross-agent 相同目标，可能使用不同实现）\"\n    expected_results:\n      oh_2lf_conf2_gb_macro_f1: 0.932\n      oh_2lf_conf2_coverage_pct: 2.81\n      oh_2lf_conf2_n_windows: 4017\n      swe_2lf_conf2_gb_macro_f1: 0.978\n      label_consistency_2lf_vs_3lf: 1.0\n      deployability_verdict: not_deployable_crossagent\n    result_rationale: |\n      与 2lf-cross-agent 相同的根本问题：cmd_rep 在 OH 上低覆盖导致 2-LF conf≥2 \n      仅覆盖 2.81%。即使覆盖到的窗口 F1 ~0.932，97% 以上的窗口无法判断。\n      label 一致性保持 100%（2-LF 和 3-LF 在交集上完全一致），确认 OB 的作用是 \n      coverage 而非 quality——但这恰好暴露了去掉 OB 后在 OH 上 coverage 的灾难性下降。\n      结论：2-LF config 在 cross-agent 场景不可部署。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 2-LF vs 3-LF Cross-Agent Comparison\"\n        columns: [Config, OH_Coverage_pct, OH_GB_F1, SWE_GB_F1, Label_Consistency]\n        rows:\n          - [3-LF_conf2, 30.3, 0.992, 0.995, \"-\"]\n          - [2-LF_conf2, 2.81, 0.932, 0.978, 100%]\n          - [2-LF_conf1, 50.7, 0.880, \"-\", \"-\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram: window coverage by LF combination on OH — showing cmd_rep ∩ file_diff is tiny\"\n    analysis: |\n      e1 和 2lf-cross-agent 测量同一个现象。核心数字：coverage 从 3-LF 的 30.3% \n      崩塌到 2-LF 的 2.81%。OB 在 OH 上 fire rate 16.79% 提供了大量额外 coverage，\n      去掉后 2-LF 几乎无法工作。\n      \n      worst tier 的 2lf_crossagent_macro_f1 [0.91, 0.945] 范围——0.932 在范围内，\n      但这个 F1 只在 2.81% 的窗口上有意义，对实际部署毫无价值。\n\n  - name: \"matched-scope-eval\"\n    plan_id: \"matched-scope-eval\"\n    description: \"Matched-scope comparison: GB vs Probe 在完全相同的评估集上对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      matched_n_windows: 6122\n      gb_matched_macro_f1: 0.952\n      probe_zeroshot_matched_macro_f1: 0.618\n      matched_scope_delta_pp: 33.4\n      gb_matched_f1_stag: 0.929\n      gb_matched_f1_prog: 0.975\n      probe_matched_f1_stag: 0.341\n      probe_matched_f1_prog: 0.895\n      bootstrap_p_value: 0.0001\n      evaluation_set: \"OH conf>=2 prevalence-matched subsample\"\n    result_rationale: |\n      Matched-scope 设计的目的是消除 evaluation set 差异带来的不公平比较。\n      在同一个 OH 子集上（~6K windows, prevalence-matched），GB 结构特征 zero-shot \n      达到 0.952（略低于 full OH 的 0.967，因为 matched subset 可能比 full set 更难），\n      probe zero-shot 仅 0.618（略高于 full OH 的 0.598，因为 subset 可能排除了 \n      最难的低置信窗口）。\n      \n      Delta=33.4pp 仍然巨大且统计显著（p<0.001），但低于 best-case 的 39.4pp。\n      原因：matched-scope 的 prevalence-matching 倾向于选择更 \"balanced\" 的子集，\n      在这些子集上 probe 表现稍好（更多 stagnation windows 给了 probe 更多 signal），\n      而 GB 在 balanced subset 上的优势略小于在 skewed full set 上。\n      \n      worst tier [30, 36] 范围——33.4pp 在中间偏上。这个数字仍然足以支撑 Claim 1 \n      的 \"structural dominance in zero-shot transfer\" 叙事，但 headline 需要从 \n      +39.4pp 修正为 +33.4pp。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Matched-Scope Zero-Shot Comparison\"\n        columns: [Method, Macro_F1, F1_Stag, F1_Prog, N_Windows]\n        rows:\n          - [Structural_GB, 0.952, 0.929, 0.975, 6122]\n          - [Probe_ZeroShot, 0.618, 0.341, 0.895, 6122]\n          - [Delta_pp, +33.4, +58.8, +8.0, \"-\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Matched vs Unmatched Comparison\"\n        columns: [Setting, GB_F1, Probe_F1, Delta_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [Full_OH_all, 0.967, 0.598, +36.9]\n          - [Matched_Scope, 0.952, 0.618, +33.4]\n          - [OH_conf2, 0.992, 0.598, +39.4]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: matched-scope comparison GB vs Probe — with 95% CI error bars\"\n      - \"Annotation: +33.4pp delta with p<0.001\"\n    analysis: |\n      +33.4pp 仍是论文的 strong headline number。worst tier 下这个数字从 +39.4pp \n      缩小到 +33.4pp（~6pp 缩减），但仍远超 meaningful threshold。\n      主要影响：论文中需要使用 matched-scope 数字而非 conf≥2 数字作为 fair comparison，\n      headline template 中的 \"+39.4pp\" 需改为 \"+33.4pp\"。\n      这对 Claim 1 的 strength 影响有限——33pp 的零样本差距仍然是 dominant advantage。\n      但如果 reviewer 同时质疑 matched-scope 方法论（\"为什么不用 full set？\"），\n      则需要在 appendix 中详细论证 matching 策略。\n\n  - name: \"e2-gb-matched-scope\"\n    plan_id: \"e2-gb-matched-scope\"\n    description: \"GB matched-scope evaluation（与 matched-scope-eval 相同目标）\"\n    expected_results:\n      matched_n_windows: 6122\n      gb_matched_macro_f1: 0.950\n      probe_zeroshot_matched_macro_f1: 0.615\n      matched_delta_pp: 33.5\n      prevalence_stag_pct: 19.3\n      bootstrap_ci_95: [29.8, 37.2]\n    result_rationale: |\n      与 matched-scope-eval 测量同一现象。细微数值差异（0.950 vs 0.952）来自 \n      specific random seed 和 matching 实现细节。Bootstrap CI [29.8, 37.2] 确认\n      delta 的下界仍 ~30pp，在 worst tier [30, 36] 范围内。\n      \n      prevalence-matched 子集（stag=19.3%）消除了 class imbalance 的影响，\n      使比较更 fair。但 GB 在 balanced set 上 F1 略低于 skewed set（0.950 vs 0.967），\n      因为更多 stagnation windows 意味着更多机会出错。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Bootstrap CI for Matched-Scope Delta\"\n        columns: [Metric, Point_Est, CI_Lower, CI_Upper, p_value]\n        rows:\n          - [Delta_macro_f1_pp, 33.5, 29.8, 37.2, \"<0.001\"]\n          - [Delta_f1_stag_pp, 57.2, 51.1, 63.3, \"<0.001\"]\n          - [Delta_f1_prog_pp, 9.8, 6.4, 13.2, \"<0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bootstrap distribution: histogram of 10K bootstrap delta samples, with 95% CI shaded\"\n    analysis: |\n      即使在 worst tier，matched-scope delta 的 95% CI 下界（29.8pp）仍远超 0。\n      Claim 1 的 statistical foundation 稳固。问题不在 Claim 1——\n      worst tier 的 damage 集中在 Claim 4 (intervention) 和 2-LF cross-agent coverage。\n\n  - name: \"llm-on-oh\"\n    plan_id: \"llm-on-oh\"\n    description: \"LLM-as-judge 在 OpenHands 轨迹上的 cross-agent 表现\"\n    expected_results:\n      claude_zeroshot_oh_macro_f1: 0.714\n      claude_fewshot_cot_oh_macro_f1: 0.762\n      gpt55_zeroshot_oh_macro_f1: 0.698\n      structural_gb_oh_ref: 0.967\n      delta_structural_vs_best_llm_pp: 20.5\n      cost_per_window_usd: 0.022\n      total_cost_usd: 45.2\n      n_windows_evaluated: 2048\n      parse_failure_rate_claude: 0.031\n      parse_failure_rate_gpt: 0.189\n    result_rationale: |\n      LLM judge 在 OH 上的表现与在 SWE 上类似或略差。在 worst tier 下，LLM judge \n      可能在 OH 上稍好于 SWE（OH 轨迹结构相对简单，tool-use 格式更容易解析），\n      但仍远低于 structural features。\n      \n      Claude few-shot-cot 从 SWE 的 0.799 降到 OH 的 0.762（-3.7pp），因为 \n      few-shot examples 来自 SWE domain，对 OH 的 tool-use 模式不完全适用。\n      Zero-shot 从 0.662 升到 0.714（+5.2pp），因为 OH 的 tool-use 格式比 SWE 的 \n      shell 命令更结构化，zero-shot prompt 能更好理解。\n      \n      GPT-5.5 parse failure rate 在 OH 上仍高（18.9%），因为 OH 的输出格式不同于 SWE。\n      \n      Structural GB 0.967 vs best LLM 0.762 = +20.5pp 差距，与 SWE 上的 +16.8pp \n      类似，进一步确认 structural dominance 跨 agent 一致。\n      \n      worst tier 影响：LLM 在 OH 上 \"不算太差\"（0.762），如果 reviewer 认为这足够好\n      则会削弱 structural approach 的 value proposition——但 20.5pp gap + 成本差异\n      （$0 vs $45.2）仍是强论据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LLM Judge Cross-Agent (OH)\"\n        columns: [Model, Variant, Macro_F1, F1_Stag, F1_Prog, Cost_USD, Parse_Fail_pct]\n        rows:\n          - [Claude, zero-shot, 0.714, 0.648, 0.780, 12.8, 3.1]\n          - [Claude, few-shot-cot, 0.762, 0.701, 0.823, 42.1, 2.4]\n          - [GPT-5.5, zero-shot, 0.698, 0.635, 0.761, 10.4, 18.9]\n          - [Structural_GB, zero-shot, 0.967, 0.948, 0.987, 0, 0]\n      - name: \"Table: LLM Cross-Agent Consistency\"\n        columns: [LLM_Variant, SWE_F1, OH_F1, Delta_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [Claude_ZS, 0.662, 0.714, +5.2]\n          - [Claude_FS-CoT, 0.799, 0.762, -3.7]\n          - [Structural_GB, 0.995, 0.967, -2.8]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: SWE vs OH performance for each method — structural nearly flat, LLM varies more\"\n    analysis: |\n      LLM 在 OH 上的结果进一步巩固 Claim 1：structural features 不仅在 SWE 上优于 LLM，\n      在 OH 上也以 20.5pp 领先。LLM 的跨 agent 一致性不如 structural（claude FS-CoT \n      在 OH 降 3.7pp，structural GB 仅降 2.8pp）。\n      这个实验对 worst tier 的 narrative 是正面的——它加强了 3-claim paper 的 Claim 1，\n      即使 Claim 4 失败，LLM cross-agent baseline 仍是有价值的补充实验。\n\n  - name: \"e4-gb-swe-gold\"\n    plan_id: \"e4-gb-swe-gold\"\n    description: \"GB structural 在 SWE-Agent gold set 子集上的表现\"\n    expected_results:\n      swe_gold_n: 337\n      swe_gold_n_eval: 328\n      swe_gold_gb_f1: 0.792\n      swe_gold_rf_f1: 0.778\n      swe_gold_mv_f1: 0.765\n      swe_gold_probe_f1: 0.771\n      swe_gold_twv_probe_f1: 0.815\n      gb_vs_mv_delta_pp: 2.7\n      gb_vs_mv_p: 0.034\n      gb_vs_probe_delta_pp: 2.1\n      gb_vs_probe_p: 0.112\n      iaa_swe_subset_kappa: 0.42\n    result_rationale: |\n      Gold set overall (Set B) GB=0.839，但 SWE-Agent 子集可能略低。\n      \n      worst tier 下 gold_swe_gb_f1 范围 [0.77, 0.82]——预测 0.792 在范围中间。\n      原因：\n      \n      1) SWE-Agent 轨迹更长更复杂（平均 ~10 steps vs OH 的结构化 tool-use），\n      人工标注者在长轨迹上判断 stagnation 更困难，导致 gold label 与 LF label \n      的 disagreement 更高。\n      \n      2) Structural features 在 SWE in-domain 上 0.995 主要是 circular eval artifact——\n      在 human gold labels 上回退到 0.792（-20.3pp），暴露了 structural approach \n      对 LF label 的依赖程度。\n      \n      3) 但 GB 仍显著优于 MV（+2.7pp, p=0.034），说明 structural model 确实学到了\n      超越 LF majority vote 的信号——这是非 circular 的真实 contribution。\n      \n      4) GB vs Probe（+2.1pp）在这个 sample size 下不显著（p=0.112），\n      这对论文叙事有影响：在 gold ground truth 上，structural 和 probe 的差距\n      可能没有 LF label 上那么大。\n      \n      5) TWV Probe（0.815）在 SWE gold 上表现不错，因为 TWV 的 temporal smoothing\n      在 SWE 的长轨迹上更有效。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: SWE-Agent Gold Subset Results\"\n        columns: [Method, Macro_F1, F1_Stag, F1_Prog, N_Eval]\n        rows:\n          - [Structural_GB, 0.792, 0.738, 0.846, 328]\n          - [Structural_RF, 0.778, 0.716, 0.840, 328]\n          - [MV_Labels, 0.765, 0.701, 0.829, 328]\n          - [GRU_Probe, 0.771, 0.712, 0.830, 328]\n          - [TWV_Probe, 0.815, 0.762, 0.868, 328]\n      - name: \"Table: Gold Set by Agent\"\n        columns: [Agent, N, GB_F1, MV_F1, GB_vs_MV_pp, p_value]\n        rows:\n          - [SWE-Agent, 328, 0.792, 0.765, +2.7, 0.034]\n          - [OpenHands, 163, 0.891, 0.834, +5.7, 0.003]\n          - [Combined_SetB, 491, 0.839, 0.798, +4.2, 0.0001]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Forest plot: per-agent GB vs MV delta with 95% CI — SWE CI crosses zero more closely than OH\"\n      - \"Scatter: gold F1 vs LF-label F1 per method — showing regression toward mean on gold\"\n    analysis: |\n      SWE gold GB=0.792 是 worst tier 的关键数字。它仍显著优于 MV（p=0.034），\n      支持论文的核心 claim（structural features detect real stagnation, not just LF artifacts）。\n      但 0.792 比 full Set B 的 0.839 低 4.7pp，说明 SWE subset 更难。\n      \n      在 3-claim paper 中这个数字可以接受：论文 narrative 是 \"structural features \n      significantly outperform MV silver labels on human-annotated ground truth\"，\n      0.792 > 0.765（p<0.05）足以支撑。但如果 reviewer 注意到 in-domain 0.995 → \n      gold 0.792 的 20pp drop，会质疑 structural approach 的 \"near-perfect\" framing。\n      \n      TWV Probe 在 SWE gold 上最优（0.815）是一个 interesting finding——\n      在 3-claim paper 中可以作为 Claim 3 (TLM) 的 silver lining：\n      虽然 TLM 没有改善 label model 本身，但 TWV labels 训练的 probe \n      在 gold ground truth 上更优。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"ed785cb3-f64b-4f32-89fc-2a6e89dfb2a6","total_cost_usd":0.6893187500000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":44749,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":14556,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":44749,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":14556,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":44749,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":44749},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":39712,"outputTokens":19,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.039806999999999995,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":14556,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":44749,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.64951175,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"bba192f4-1bff-4005-b3f5-d37298223aba"}
